<?php if(allow(['sales','production'])):?><details class="panel editor" id="editor" <?=($edit||isset($_GET['new']))?'open':''?>><summary><?=$edit?'Editar projeto':'Cadastrar projeto'?></summary><div class="editor-inner"><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('projects.save'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="_back" value="projects"><input name="id" type="hidden" value="<?=e($edit['id']??'')?>"><div class="form-grid cols-3"><div class="field span-2"><label>Nome do projeto *</label><input name="title" required placeholder="Ex.: Cozinha planejada" value="<?=e($edit['title']??'')?>"></div><div class="field"><label>Ambiente</label><input name="environment" placeholder="Cozinha / Dormitório / Sala" value="<?=e($edit['environment']??'')?>"></div>
<div class="field"><label>Cliente *</label><select name="customer_id" required><option value="">Selecione...</option><?php foreach($clients as $c):?><option value="<?=e($c['id'])?>" <?=($edit['customer_id']??'')==$c['id']?'selected':''?>><?=e($c['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div class="field"><label>Situação</label><select name="status"><?php foreach(['planning','approved','in_production','installation','completed','cancelled'] as $s):?><option value="<?=e($s)?>" <?=($edit['status']??'planning')===$s?'selected':''?>><?=e(label_status($s))?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div class="field"><label>Entrega prevista</label><input name="due_date" type="date" value="<?=e($edit['due_date']??'')?>"></div><div class="field span-3"><label>Descrição / Especificações</label><textarea name="description" placeholder="Materiais, acabamentos e observações do cliente"><?=e($edit['description']??'')?></textarea></div><div class="field span-3"><label>Medidas / Levantamento técnico</label><textarea name="measurements" placeholder="Anote dimensões, medidas de ambientes e referências"><?=e($edit['measurements']??'')?></textarea></div></div><div class="form-footer"><button class="btn-aurora">Salvar projeto</button><a href="<?=e(url('projects'))?>" class="btn-aurora btn-outline-aurora">Cancelar</a></div></form></div></details><?php endif;?>
<div class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><h2>Carteira de projetos</h2><p>Acompanhamento comercial e operacional</p></div><span class="tag"><?=count($projects)?> projetos</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Projeto</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Ambiente</th><th>Prazo</th><th>Situação</th><th>Ações</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($projects as $p):?><tr><td><strong><?=e($p['title'])?></strong><small>#<?=e($p['id'])?> · Criado em <?=e(date_br($p['created_at']))?></small></td><td><?=e($p['customer_name'])?></td><td><?=e($p['environment']?:'—')?></td><td><?=e(date_br($p['due_date']))?></td><td><?=status_badge($p['status'])?></td><td><div class="table-actions"><?php if(allow(['sales','production'])):?><a href="<?=e(url('projects',['edit'=>$p['id']]))?>#editor" class="btn-aurora btn-outline-aurora btn-sm-aurora"><?=svg_icon('edit',14)?></a><?php endif;?><a href="<?=e(url('cuts',['project_id'=>$p['id']]))?>" class="btn-aurora btn-outline-aurora btn-sm-aurora">Peças</a></div></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$projects):?><tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">Nenhum projeto cadastrado.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></div>
